        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Nim has immunity 1 to cold, corruption, lightning, and poison, and fire weakness 5. At negative winded Stamina, Nim is inert rather than dying; fire damage while inert destroys the body. <strong>Bloodless:</strong> Nim can't be made bleeding.</p>",
