      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Procedure.</strong> If the deal closes, the Director can run one Whiteout-style scrub (@UUID[Compendium.draw-steel-ghostwire.matrix.Item.wHt0uT7mAgK3s1cQ]{Whiteout}) on a named host log or on the crew's Trace fiction, moving Trace or logs by hand. This is a farewell weird, not a mid-fight program.</p>",
