      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Main action or maneuver · Wire.</strong> While Connected on Overlay or Jacked In, Nim runs @UUID[Compendium.draw-steel-ghostwire.matrix.Item.OepS68mz9km9j8EU]{Static} by reference: suppress one enemy device, camera, smartlink, or watcher ping for a round (a strong result may hit several). Nim then shifts and leaves by the east intersection. A low Wire result is a soft civic scrape, never live-train Trace.</p>",
